    "display_title": "feat(store): a unit's state through one writer, with each squad's living and downed kept (spec 35 step 7a)",
    "event": "pull_request",
    "head_branch": "claude/run-phase-spec-35-step-7-hk07ii",
    "head_commit_message": "feat(store): a unit's state through one writer, with each squad's living and downed kept (spec 35 step 7a)\n\nUnitState.put makes every change to a unit's state, and each squad keeps its\nliving and its downed (DOWNED or CARRIED) in squad.units order: a write or a\nregather marks the squad, and its next read rebuilds both lists once into new,\nread-only arrays. living() is O(1). Wounds, taking, recovery and carry walk\nthe downed lists instead of every unit; the native syncs walk living().\ncheck_one_state.py holds the one writer and flags a caller changing a kept\nlist. State stays on the record (Decision 147).\n\nWaived-by: Decision 147\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RP9r1H2aZX49p5D4s6iUo3",
